BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FFXIV] The Moonfire Faire Begins August 12!
DTSTART:20260812T000000Z
DTEND:20260826T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260818T064814Z
UID:c169856f3ac8@mmo-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Summer is here once more\, with fireworks lighting the night s
 ky and festive decorations adorning the streets below. The sandy shores of
  Costa del Sol offer the perfect respite from the sweltering heat\, so it
 ’s time to dive right in and make a splash at the Moonfire Faire!
URL:https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/topics/detail/3817357c7556773
 cf1a07db2646a6d92245ada43
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FFXIV] Gather One\, Gather All─Yo-kai Watch Returns to Eorzea!
DTSTART:20260728T092100Z
DTEND:20260811T092100Z
DTSTAMP:20260818T064817Z
UID:45d910b58d44@mmo-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Once more\, a horde of Yo-kai descends upon Eorzea!\n\n Join i
 n the fun and get your paws on weapons\, mounts\, a framer’s kit\, and m
 inions─including Jibanyan and Whisper! This time around\, the event feat
 ures three new indoor furnishings: wibbly-wobbly Jibanyan\, wibbly-wobbly 
 Komasan\, and wibbly-wobbly USApyon.
URL:https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/topics/detail/5e9868fb47977cb
 d45effe2a50bdb78a2270430c
END:VEVENT
